# Sysadmin hiding in Project 21's server room.
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: (From between the racks.) Don't power-cycle anything. Don't touch the terminal. Don't tell them I'm here.
#
o_text: What is Project 21?
o_id: vee_p21
o_goto: P21
#
o_text: Why are you hiding?
o_id: vee_hiding
o_goto: Hiding
#
o_text: Your secret.
o_id: vee_leave
o_goto: End

name: P21
npc: The "Home Companion" is the brochure. The racks train a model on the cleansing footage from the south wall.
+ Who was tagged, who was passed over, and why. It is learning to pick. Nobody will say for what.
#
o_text: (Back)
o_id: p21_back
o_goto: Default

name: Hiding
npc: I asked what the tags were for. My badge died the same afternoon. Down here I am the only one who knows which fuse is which.
+ That is a kind of tenure.
#
o_text: (Back)
o_id: hiding_back
o_goto: Default

name: End
npc: (She pulls the sleeping bag back over the cables.)
effect: EndConversation
